  "universalDesignLaws": [
    "100% original handcrafted CAD vector outlines (zero third-party derivative contours)",
    "Zero sharp edges across all letters, numerals, punctuation, bullets, triangles, and symbols",
    "Exact CAP=720, BASE=0 flush landing metrics across all weights",
    "Crisp non-thin Regular (400, 1.00x) with dramatic visible step to SemiBold (600, 1.28x) and ExtraBold (800, 1.58x)",
    "Slim uniform CAP-height tabular numerals (0-9) with diagonal-slashed zero distinct from o/O",
    "WCAG AAA & extreme low-res OCR disambiguation: 0/o/O, a/b/6, I/l/1, rn/m, cl/d",
    "Default 3D Pressed Impression with Mild Gradient Effect embedded natively via hybrid COLRv1 (PaintLinearGradient) + COLRv0 + CPAL + OpenType-SVG (<linearGradient>) across all 27 styles"
  ],
